---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout>
  <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto pb-32">
    <div class="@container max-w-md mx-auto">
      <div class="p-4">
        <div class="relative w-full aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-primary/20 shadow-lg" data-alt="Imagen" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBjxk1b8kO1hEjmOiOV-nUvk69wMz-0c1jtOG3L-UBZQRe41eG_RBRnT0BlLLHmR-Jy1opAYfdEKQAprkAyhPTZG3WLvh1Y7HqOmJjKwI13Yvvz0_pzNPlvKvyaYddd9_oQ5wVDjTsWpGgWb1-uEPxiKI099-GBY6bi-2ahKq9nvpwC_1RETNbbNWShj0SwPtmNFGhma-4rLS2tR-phKDvwTuStOm9Tem2A7XeMmOhWpol_GObk084tNDzg4uaPC69ES5rNlQ-xZNo'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background-dark/60 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest">Sabor Real</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="px-6 py-4">
        <h1 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight mb-4">Nuestra Historia</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">Nacimos de nuestras raíces venezolanas, llevando el secreto de nuestra masa de maíz artesanal y la pasión por los sabores auténticos directamente a tu hogar.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">En <span class="text-primary font-semibold">unmandado.com</span>, cada bocado es un viaje a nuestra tierra. Lo que empezó como una receta familiar en una cocina pequeña, hoy es nuestra forma de conectar contigo a través de la frescura y el amor por lo hecho a mano.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="px-6 py-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-primary/10 mt-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">star</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Tradición</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Calidad</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">eco</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Frescura</h3>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mx-4 mb-8 p-6 rounded-xl bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">handshake</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Compromiso con la Comunidad</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">No solo entregamos comida, construimos puentes. Apoyamos a productores locales y trabajamos para que la cultura gastronómica de Venezuela siga viva en cada rincón de nuestra comunidad.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="px-6 pb-6">
        <button class="w-full bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">restaurant_menu</span>
          Ver el Menú
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
